==Notes==
*Armor (and thus Steel Fiber) will only mitigate damage to Health.
**This mod does '''not''' improve Shields.
**As {{A|Snow Globe}} gains additional health from {{WF|Frost}}'s armor, Steel Fiber affects it.

==Tips==
*This mod is generally more effective on frames with 100 armor or greater.
**Steel Fiber is most effective when used on {{WF|Valkyr Prime}} as she has 1000 armor, the second highest value of any Warframe.

